 "Explore paid packs, battle passes, and supply bundles. Generate official direct purchase links using your game client account parameters.": "Jelajahi paket berbayar, battle pass, dan paket suplai. Buat tautan pembelian langsung resmi memakai parameter akun klien game-mu.",
