 "Press Start, then log into your character in Hykros. If you are elsewhere, teleport to Hykros and log into your character again.": "Tekan Start, lalu login ke karaktermu di Hykros. Jika kamu berada di tempat lain, teleportasi ke Hykros dan login lagi ke karaktermu.",
 "Open two windows": "Buka dua jendela",
 "Upload the file": "Unggah berkasnya",
